        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "NOTE Since SECCID is included in the SECC certificate, the only way to change the SECCID is to update the SECC certificate. The CSO/SA operating the SECC can update the SECC certificate in the SECC with a new one. At its discretion, the CSO/SA operating the SECC can choose to use a different SECCID in this new SECC certificate. Changing the certificate while it is in use can result in unforeseen issues.",
